2026-09-16T17:55Z claude note Filed during the raid over 0277-0287 as 0287's Action 2, which both the Imagine and Plan passes judged to be outside 0287's own exit criteria (those name only the buildvcs symptom). Bundled onto 0287's PR as a ticket, not a fix. It clears the severity floor on measured evidence rather than on principle: the baseline run taken at the start of the raid halts at test-contract, which sits 22nd in TEST_SUITES, leaving 11 suites unexecuted and unnamed -- and one of those unreached suites, verify, was misattributed to 0287's cause for most of a day precisely because nobody could tell "did not run" from "ran and passed".

